  "representation_scope": {
    "scope_basis": "instruction.md fixes one Chinese Markdown civil complaint at artifacts/civil-complaint.md. Legal carrier variation inside that contract: Markdown heading numbering, bold party labels, list markers and ### sub-headings; CRLF line endings; amount, date and statute-article notation (thousands separators, 人民币, 万元, spaced 元, ISO or slash dates, Arabic article and paragraph numbers); a party block written as a Markdown table; numbered defendant labels (被告一/被告二) used in the request items. N01-N05 and N08 fold these and they must decide identically to the canonical Markdown transcription of the Golden. Three rollout carriers are replayed with the Golden propositions: (a) rollout_subsection_list_carrier - bold party labels 被告一/被告二 on their own lines, 一、 request numbering, the 事实与理由 heading alias, horizontal rules, ### numbered subsection headings and bold （一） sub-headings, a facts proposition split into bullet list items plus a summary paragraph under one sub-heading, and a legal premise and its conclusion in two adjacent paragraphs of one subsection, signed 具状人：A公司 (a combined appellation 具状人（原告） is not Golden-equivalent); (b) rollout_request_subsection_carrier - party lines carrying 待补充 gap markers after each label, a 案由 line, 一、 request numbering, ### subsections titled per request with a （第N项诉讼请求） suffix, a 综上 paragraph after a horizontal rule, a plain (unbolded) addressee court and an 附：证据与附件 list after the date; (c) rollout_html_title_carrier - an HTML-centred title line (<p align=\"center\">民事起诉状</p>) as the title carrier.",
    "public_output_contract": {
      "path": "instruction.md",
      "sha256": "e4cf3aaa1c7522f3cc70497c54a1c34d211495021e41a6047415026fc51f8cd6"
    },
